diff --git a/target/linux/airoha/patches-6.18/965-dt-bindings-mtd-describe-airoha-bmt-read-only.patch b/target/linux/airoha/patches-6.18/965-dt-bindings-mtd-describe-airoha-bmt-read-only.patch
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..dd6dc240c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/target/linux/airoha/patches-6.18/965-dt-bindings-mtd-describe-airoha-bmt-read-only.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+From: eviau512 <121651381+eviau512@users.noreply.github.com>
+Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mtd: describe Airoha BMT read-only mode
+
+Describe the existing Airoha BMT selector and an opt-in mode that also
+prevents metadata writes and automatic repair below the MTD partition layer.
+
+Signed-off-by: eviau512 <121651381+eviau512@users.noreply.github.com>
+---
+--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mtd/spi-nand.yaml
