+normal flowtable rule construction. Include the effective directional zone,
+raw zone settings, direction and explicit initial-network-namespace status.
+Ordinary TC rules have no such provenance. No CT pointer or new packet match
+key is exposed. This experimental internal API is not a hardware admission.
+
+Use the snapshot only for precise AN7563 routed-rejection diagnostics. Keep
+all routed classification, native bind, station and DMA ownership guards.
+The classifier remains L2-only and every routed request remains unsupported.
+The internal flow_rule layout changes: rebuild the complete matching kernel
+and modules before any future image; never install these objects in isolation.
+
